WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.958 --> 00:00:04.416
It's gonna be a beautiful wedding!

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:08.750
Here you are,

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.500
standing on the precipice 
of something so much bigger

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.500
than anyone here.

00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:14.250
But always remember:
you are not alone.

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:15.875
I don't think that we met, I'm Sarah.

00:00:16.125 --> 00:00:16.750
Nyles.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:17.541
- Hi.
- Hi.

00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:23.541
Nice.

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:26.250
Ow!

00:00:26.875 --> 00:00:28.250
What the fuck is happening!?

00:00:28.666 --> 00:00:30.208
Run, rabbit, run!

00:00:32.708 --> 00:00:33.250
Nyles?

00:00:33.458 --> 00:00:34.458
Don't come in here!

00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:35.791
What the...

00:00:38.125 --> 00:00:39.875
It's gonna be a beautiful wedding!

00:00:42.258 --> 00:00:43.291
Good day so far?

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.018
Today, tomorrow, it's all the same.

00:00:45.175 --> 00:00:46.950
You! What is going on?

00:00:47.241 --> 00:00:48.325
Hey! Get out of the water!

00:00:50.741 --> 00:00:51.741
Guess you followed me.

00:00:52.116 --> 00:00:55.366
It's one of those infinite time loop
situations you might've heard about.

00:00:55.616 --> 00:00:56.825
That I might've heard about?

00:00:57.366 --> 00:00:57.991
Yeah...

00:01:01.116 --> 00:01:03.700
The second you fall asleep,
it all just goes back to the start.

00:01:04.075 --> 00:01:06.533
I drove all the way back home to Austin

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:07.825
and I still woke up here.

00:01:08.075 --> 00:01:11.366
One time, I smoked a bunch of crystal
and made it all the way to Equatorial Guinea.

00:01:11.658 --> 00:01:12.950
It was a huge waste of time.

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:16.700
Well then what's the point of living?

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.616
We kind of have no choice but to live?

00:01:18.783 --> 00:01:20.366
No, I'm gonna get out of this.

00:01:20.991 --> 00:01:21.866
Suit yourself.

00:01:22.741 --> 00:01:23.408
See you tomorrow.

00:01:25.533 --> 00:01:27.116
[Screaming]

00:01:28.991 --> 00:01:29.925
So now what do we do?

00:01:29.925 --> 00:01:32.658
You just have to embrace the fact
that nothing matters.

00:01:32.741 --> 00:01:33.741
Do you sleep with people in here?

00:01:33.741 --> 00:01:34.575
Great question.

00:01:34.575 --> 00:01:36.825
I have, but it takes a lot of work.

00:01:37.283 --> 00:01:38.075
May I cut in?

00:01:38.991 --> 00:01:39.883
It's the first dance.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.133
And that's a deal-breaker?

00:01:41.658 --> 00:01:42.408
And that didn't work?

00:01:43.658 --> 00:01:44.716
Let's waste some time.

00:01:52.991 --> 00:01:53.991
This is crazy!

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:55.658
You want to, uh, dance?

00:01:55.991 --> 00:01:56.825
You know the officiant?

00:01:56.825 --> 00:01:58.241
He's got a bag of "sweets" in his pocket.

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:01.616
You were right! Got 'em!

00:02:07.366 --> 00:02:08.700
I can't keep waking up in here.

00:02:11.658 --> 00:02:12.658
Everything that we are doing

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:14.325
is meaningless.

00:02:15.491 --> 00:02:16.825
I hope it's not all meaningless.

00:02:17.825 --> 00:02:18.866
At least you have each other.

00:02:18.866 --> 00:02:20.783
Nothing worse than going
through this shit alone.

00:02:24.075 --> 00:02:25.075
Stop!

00:02:25.075 --> 00:02:26.283
There's a bomb in the cake!

00:02:26.575 --> 00:02:28.450
Don't worry, I used to be
a bomb guy.

00:02:28.575 --> 00:02:29.550
Stand back!

00:02:32.083 --> 00:02:33.500
Oh my God!

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:38.466
It's gonna be a beautiful wedding!

